    "text": "source\n\nSolution\n\n Solution (*values)\n\nResult of puzzle solution by solver\n\nsource\n\n\nBoard\n\n Board (initial_cells)\n\nInitializes the board given the initial cell state\n\n\n\n\nDetails\n\n\n\n\ninitial_cells\ninitial cell state\n\n\n\n\nsource\n\n\nBoard.show\n\n Board.show (with_candidates=True)\n\nGives a textual representation of the actual state of the board\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nType\nDefault\nDetails\n\n\n\n\nwith_candidates\nbool\nTrue\nalso shows candidate values for cells\n\n\n\n\nsource\n\n\nBoard.solve\n\n Board.solve (use_brute_force=False, print_log=False, print_results=True,\n              check_many_solutions=False)\n\nTries to solve the board given its current state\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nType\nDefault\nDetails\n\n\n\n\nuse_brute_force\nbool\nFalse\nif methods based on logic fail, solve the puzzle traying all values for the remaining cells\n\n\nprint_log\nbool\nFalse\nprint logs\n\n\nprint_results\nbool\nTrue\nprint final board\n\n\ncheck_many_solutions\nbool\nFalse\ndo not stop after first solution; if more than one solution exist, report it\n\n\nReturns\nSolution",
